{"id":"wb-3-21","name":"黄埔军校旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"黄埔军校旧址","text":"黄埔军校旧址位于中国广州市黄埔区长洲岛内，是孙中山创办的新式军事政治学校“中国国民党陆军军官学校”（黄埔军校）的首个校址，包括校本部、孙总理纪念室、孙总理纪念碑、俱乐部、游泳池等建筑，总面积约5.7万平方米。1984年6月被辟为纪念馆，成为广州市的知名旅游景点。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%84%E5%9F%94%E5%86%9B%E6%A0%A1%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":94300593,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94300593","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f4a347273448f7392e47d763.jpg","title":"Site_of_Whampoa_Military_Academy.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Site_of_Whampoa_Military_Academy.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/Site_of_Whampoa_Military_Academy.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"慕尼黑啤酒","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​黄埔军校旧址","width":320,"height":240}}